<title>USA: WCI Steel OKs $1.2 mln stock repurchase.</title>
<headline>WCI Steel OKs $1.2 mln stock repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, Ohio 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>WCI Steel Inc said Tuesday it authorized spending up to $1.2 million to buy its own common stock from time to time on the open market or in privately negotiated deals.</p>
<p>This follows the completion in July of a share repurchase program in which the company bought 222,300 common shares.</p>
<p>The company said there can be no assurance it will make the additional share repurchase. WCI said The Renco Group, its majority stockholder, has said it does not intend to sell any of its holdings back to WCI.</p>
</text>
